WEBVTT

00:00:00.152 --> 00:00:04.876
Generate endpoints from a database.

00:00:04.876 --> 00:00:09.914
Open the Developer Console and sign in with your console token.

00:00:09.914 --> 00:00:14.390
Open a SQL gateway.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.160
Scroll to Auto-generate endpoints.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:22.931
Choose the app that should receive the routes, then generate.

00:00:22.931 --> 00:00:25.934
naimix reports what it created. Existing ids are never overwritten.

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:33.450
The new routes now show in the app.
